resources.string:
Please design a recipe.
Requirement: {{EXTRA_NOTE}}
Available ingredients: {{INVENTORY_BLOCK}}

To allow my app to import it automatically, please strictly follow this JSON format. You must only output valid JSON without any extra text explanations.
The JSON structure must strictly follow this Schema:

{
 "name": "Recipe Name",
 "kcalPerServing": 500.0,
 "protein": 20.0,
 "carbs": 30.0,
 "fats": 10.0,
 "ingredients": [{"name": "Ingredient Name", "amount": 100.0}],
 "steps": ["Step 1", "Step 2"],
 "tagsV2": {"mealType": ["Dinner"]}
}

Please ensure `kcalPerServing` is a Double type and field names are correct. Please try to estimate accurate nutrients based on the ingredients.
